  "description": "Immerse yourself in the warmth of Easter with our mixed media collage featuring earthy and textured tones. Crafted to evoke a rustic and cozy mood, this seamless pattern of Easter nests brings a touch of nature to your space. Embrace the artistry of nature in a unique and charming way.\nDiscover these enchanting designs, perfect for a variety of creative applications. Whether you’re working on fabric, stationery, digital backgrounds, website elements, and more, these captivating patterns are tailored to seamlessly enhance your projects. Specifically designed for easy integration with Canva.\n••• This set includes:\n••••••>   15 PATTERNS •\n••••••>   SEAMLESS PATTERN – Endless Harmony •\n••••••>   Size: 1024 x 1024 •\n••••••>   Easy to use •\n••••••>   Unique Designs – Perfect for a variety of projects •\n••••••>   High-Quality •\n••••••>   Commercial use allowed •\nImportant notes:\n–> Dimensions can be resized to suit your needs.\n–> The original files comes WITHOUT the watermark.\n–> This is an instant digital download, no physical items will be shipped.\n–> Colors may vary depending on devices and printers.\nIdeal for fabric, paper, and digital scrapbooking, this versatile pattern unlocks creative possibilities for custom t-shirts, mugs, and more. Download now to unleash your creativity!\nThank you for exploring my store!\n♥ Canvas Elegance",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Immerse yourself in the warmth of Easter with our mixed media collage featuring earthy and textured tones. Crafted to evoke a rustic and cozy mood, this seamless pattern of Easter nests brings a touch of nature to your space. Embrace the artistry of nature in a unique and charming way.</p>\n<p>Discover these enchanting designs, perfect for a variety of creative applications. Whether you’re working on fabric, stationery, digital backgrounds, website elements, and more, these captivating patterns are tailored to seamlessly enhance your projects. Specifically designed for easy integration with Canva.</p>\n<p>••• This set includes:<br>\n••••••&gt;   15 PATTERNS •<br>\n••••••&gt;   SEAMLESS PATTERN – Endless Harmony •<br>\n••••••&gt;   Size: 1024 x 1024 •<br>\n••••••&gt;   Easy to use •<br>\n••••••&gt;   Unique Designs – Perfect for a variety of projects •<br>\n••••••&gt;   High-Quality •<br>\n••••••&gt;   Commercial use allowed •</p>\n<p>Important notes:<br>\n–&gt; Dimensions can be resized to suit your needs.<br>\n–&gt; The original files comes WITHOUT the watermark.<br>\n–&gt; This is an instant digital download, no physical items will be shipped.<br>\n–&gt; Colors may vary depending on devices and printers.</p>\n<p>Ideal for fabric, paper, and digital scrapbooking, this versatile pattern unlocks creative possibilities for custom t-shirts, mugs, and more. Download now to unleash your creativity!</p>\n<p>Thank you for exploring my store!<br>\n♥ Canvas Elegance</p>",
